{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (DOCTOR): Come on in, Mr Hale. Bit wet out there. What's brought you along?",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (PATIENT): Knee.",
  "[SEG0003] person_1 (DOCTOR): Which knee, and what's it like?",
  "[SEG0004] person_2 (PATIENT): Right. Sharp. Down stairs. And at night.",
  "[SEG0005] person_1 (DOCTOR): How long's that been going? Roughly is fine.",
  "[SEG0006] person_2 (PATIENT): Last winter. Or the one before.",
  "[SEG0007] person_1 (DOCTOR): Can't sort which winter?",
  "[SEG0008] person_2 (PATIENT): Dunno.",
  "[SEG0009] person_1 (DOCTOR): No worries at all. Any swelling, or does it give way?",
  "[SEG0010] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0011] person_1 (DOCTOR): Left knee behaving itself?",
  "[SEG0012] person_2 (PATIENT): Fine.",
  "[SEG0013] person_1 (DOCTOR): Parking was a nightmare, hey. Anyway, been to the chemist for this?",
  "[SEG0014] person_2 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0015] person_1 (DOCTOR): What did you get?",
  "[SEG0016] person_2 (PATIENT): Voltaren gel. Twice a day.",
  "[SEG0017] person_1 (DOCTOR): Easy to rub in?",
  "[SEG0018] person_2 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0019] person_1 (DOCTOR): And tablets from the chemist as well?",
  "[SEG0020] person_2 (PATIENT): Diclofenac. Twenty-five milligrams. For the knee.",
  "[SEG0021] person_1 (DOCTOR): How do you take those?",
  "[SEG0022] person_2 (PATIENT): Swallowed. Few times a week.",
  "[SEG0023] person_1 (DOCTOR): Any stomach problems with them?",
  "[SEG0024] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0025] person_1 (DOCTOR): Anything else you take for the pain?",
  "[SEG0026] person_2 (PATIENT): Panadol.",
  "[SEG0027] person_1 (DOCTOR): The Panadol at night, by mouth, for the knee?",
  "[SEG0028] person_2 (PATIENT): Yeah. Two five-hundred milligram tablets.",
  "[SEG0029] person_1 (DOCTOR): Any allergies to medicines?",
  "[SEG0030] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0031] person_1 (DOCTOR): How's your weight sitting these days? Knees do notice.",
  "[SEG0032] person_2 (PATIENT): Ninety-eight kilos.",
  "[SEG0033] person_1 (DOCTOR): Has it crept up?",
  "[SEG0034] person_2 (PATIENT): Bit.",
  "[SEG0035] person_1 (DOCTOR): Are you getting any walks in?",
  "[SEG0036] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0037] person_1 (DOCTOR): Fair enough. Hop up and I'll have a feel of the right knee.",
  "[SEG0038] person_2 (PATIENT): Okay.",
  "[SEG0039] person_1 (DOCTOR): No swelling, it bends fully, tender along the inner side.",
  "[SEG0040] person_1 (DOCTOR): Sounds like osteoarthritis to me. I'll book you in with the physio, and you can keep those diclofenac tablets going.",
  "[SEG0041] person_2 (PATIENT): Heartburn.",
  "[SEG0042] person_1 (DOCTOR): Heartburn? You said the stomach was alright.",
  "[SEG0043] person_2 (PATIENT): Sometimes. After the tablets.",
  "[SEG0044] person_1 (DOCTOR): That changes my mind, then. Stop the diclofenac tablets. Keep the Voltaren gel twice a day. I won't refer you for physio today.",
  "[SEG0045] person_1 (DOCTOR): We might try physio, or a cortisone injection in the knee. I won't decide that now. If it's not better in six weeks, come back and we'll pick one."
 ],
